; §18 stretch — vector round-trip. `(vec3-length [3.0 4.0 0.0])`
; encodes a vector of three numbers (tag `0x06`, count=3, three tag
; `0x01` numbers) into the plugin args, dispatches `wasm:vec3_length`,
; and decodes the returned `sqrt(x²+y²+z²)` back as a number frame.
; A clean diagnostic stream proves nested values cross the boundary
; intact — the host encoder/decoder pair and the plugin-side decoder
; agree on the §9.1 vector layout. Skipped on Zig-native + TS-parity
; (no wasm runtime).
(use-plugin "double")

(vec3-length [3.0 4.0 0.0])
